    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original positive-cast bed-sole slab deliberately shown sole-face-up for teaching. Six aligned rounded spoon-like raised forms grade into thinner pointed tails and merge continuously with neutral-gray substrate. SERC/NAGT sole-mark description consulted; unavailable inherited USGS PDFs retained without full-read claims. Original uncut nominal0.60m span (current cropped span0.583m), relief depths, spacing and orientation are original art choices. No excavated specimen replica, animal footprints, random pebbles, negative furrows, exact paleoflow measurement or process simulation.",
      "zh": "原创正凸模层底岩板，教学展示主动将层底朝上。六个同向圆匙状隆起渐变为较薄尖尾，与中性灰基底连续。已查SERC/NAGT层底构造说明；原USGS PDF访问受限如实保留，不声称已读全文。原未裁件0.60米名义片区（当前裁后最长跨距0.583米）、浮雕深度、间距及方向为原创美术设定。不复制出土标本，不作动物足迹、随机卵石或凹沟，不主张精确古流向测定或过程模拟。"
    },
    "reconstruction_type": "artistic-concept",
